    "Retain a closing sample for a two-sample curved contour. Raw commands, native point count and control indices remain unchanged; discarded straight contours do not shift retained curve indices.",
    "Clip staging preserves short curved contours before registering borrowed source verbs. Straight short contours stay empty.",
    "An owner with no commands is intentional suppression and stays nonpainting. The existing zero-radius symbol reference is preserved.",
    "Existing budgeted preparation owns added points and growth. No new owner, metadata arena, epsilon, coordinate nudge, fitting change or alternate renderer."
